# Wartender (M7, D-105): a tourist waiting in the queue to Cafe Zauner, on an
# "Abstand halten" floor dot, phone in hand. Three looks as anims (a mixed
# queue, no national caricature):
#   0: a white sun hat with a G band, a green Tracht jacket G/j, grey trousers.
#   1: a blue baseball cap S/b, a lime shirt y/g, a big backpack O/l, shorts.
#   2: a straw hat Y/o with an R band, a green Dirndl G with a pink p apron,
#      a camera m/d on an l strap (she takes the photo with it).
# idle_N: checks the phone (the phone bobs 1 px). selfie_N: the Selfie-Tourist
# convention (frame 0 = phone up, frame 1 = flash; the engine picks the frame).
# squished_N: sits down on the floor dot, arms crossed, sulking.
# Always drawn facing right (towards the counter), no mirror. Same scale,
# outline and hitbox as selfie_tourist. Built with a scratch script (layers +
# automatic k outline), frozen to text here.
sprite = wartender
size   = 16x24
origin = 8,24
hitbox = 2,4,12,20
mirror = none
anim   = idle_0     frames=2 ticks=40 loop
anim   = idle_1     frames=2 ticks=40 loop
anim   = idle_2     frames=2 ticks=40 loop
anim   = selfie_0   frames=2 ticks=24
anim   = selfie_1   frames=2 ticks=24
anim   = selfie_2   frames=2 ticks=24
anim   = squished_0 frames=1
anim   = squished_1 frames=1
anim   = squished_2 frames=1
